    "title": "Product Manufacturing",
    "description": "The driver motherboard of a hair dryer product is an independent core component, which determines various functional parameters of the product, temperature in different modes, operating voltage, and other key data. LBH Electric independently designs, manufactures and tests hair dryer drivers to ensure that hair dryer products have consistently excellent quality and performance.",
